2. Reconstructed game code and original game material

This repository includes reconstructed Jet Grind Radio game and DSP code.
The MIT grant covers original contributions within those implementations, not
rights in any underlying SEGA or other third-party work. Reconstruction,
conversion, and local generation do not relicense third-party material.
Original game assets are not distributed with the project; users supply their
own supported disc image.

